From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ps5cemu <ps5cemu@localhost>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 20:52:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] PS5: the console's keyboard in VR runs from swkbd's state
 outside Cemu's ImGui frame, every swkbd export reports its calls, and the
 port's dialog can cancel the game's keyboard as the hardware's cancel does;
 built, untested on console

